            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abandi abokhubakofu baIsiraeli nibanzitsila, nibeekhala imbeli wanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liOMWAMI nilinzitsila, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana womundu, abandu bano beenjisiye emindu echia beenamilanga mumioyo chiabwe, nibara eshiisichirasio shiobumayaanu bwabwe imbeli wetsimoni tsiabwe; kho nasi ereebungwekhwo ninabo noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho osungane ninabo, nobaboolela ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Buli mundu weinzu yaIsiraeli owinjisinjia mumwoyokwe eminduchie echia yeenamilanga, noureetsanga eshiisichirasio shiobumayaanubwe imbeli wetsimonitsie, ne niyeetsa khumunabii, isie OMWAMI ndalamukalusiamwo omwene, khulwa obunji bweminduchie chienechio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu ehambe emioyo chiabeinzu yaIsiraeli, shichila bakwile abasuku khwisie khulwa emindu chiabwe echia beenamilanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, osunjile abeinzu yalsiraeli ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Mwikalukhasie, mushiukhane okhurula khumindu chieenywe echia mwinamilanga, nimufutaarila ebisinyo bieenywe biosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba buli mundu weinzu yaIsiraeli, kata owomubarende abamenya muIsiraeli, owikabukhasia ninasi, niyeenjisia eminduchie tsana mumwoyokwe, nara eshiisichirasio shiobumayaanubwe imbeli wetsimonitsie, mana niyeetsa khumunabii okhureeba ewanje khukeke, isie OMWAMI ndalalamukalusiamwo omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalarakhwo omwoyo okhufukula omundu oyo, nimukhola abe eshilolelo khandi oluchelo; ne ndalamukhalaka arule hakari wabandu banje; mana mulamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omunabii oyo naba nakaatibwa naboola likhuwa, nisie OMWAMI ouba nimukaatiye omunabii oyo; ne ndalanyiila omukhono kwanje khuye, nimumalilana hakari wabandu banje Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obukuumwi bwobumayaanu bwabwe bulaba khubo; obukuumwi bwomunabii nabwo bulaba bulala nobukuumwi bwa oyo oumureebakhwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu inzu yaIsiraeli yileshe okhushiama khandi okhurulakhwo, kata okhwira mwibilu khandi khulwa obumayaanu bwabwe bwosi ta; ne mbu babeetsenje abandu banje, nasi nimba Nyasaye wabwe; nolwa Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukuumi bwaNyasaye khuYerusaletnu nihabwene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
